treekipedia:AngMaFaFbCx09076-00 tkp:ecologicalFunction "Nitrogen-fixing legume that enriches soil and supports ecosystem recovery. As an Acacia, provides cover for smaller plants, habitat for native animals and birds, stabilizes soils, and plays integral role in nutrient cycling. Pioneer species that can regenerate quickly after disturbance." .
