treekipedia:AngMaFaFbCx09076-00 tkp:generalDescription "A spindly, glabrous shrub or tree growing 2-8 m high, native to south-eastern Queensland. It has smooth bark and linear phyllodes 6-19 cm long and 2-5 mm wide, often gradually narrowed towards the apex. The species is geographically restricted to Mts Barney, French, Gillies and Maroon." .
