treekipedia:AngMaFaFbCx09076-00 tkp:nativeHabitats "Endemic to south-eastern Queensland mountains including Mts Barney, French, Gillies and Maroon. Also occurs in New South Wales. Adapted to rocky, well-drained soils on volcanic substrates." .
