treekipedia:AngMaFaFbCx09076-00 tkp:plantingRecipes "Plant in well-drained soil in full sun. Suited to rocky, volcanic soils similar to native habitat. As a nitrogen-fixer, suitable for poor-quality or degraded sites. Best planted in early spring after last frost. Young plants need deep, infrequent irrigation every 1-2 weeks until established." .
