treekipedia:AngMaFaFbCx09076-00 tkp:propagation_methods "Seed propagation. Seeds require scarification or heat treatment to break dormancy - pour near-boiling water over seeds and allow to cool before sowing. Plant in well-drained potting mix at depth of twice seed thickness. Germination typically in 10-20 days." .
