treekipedia:AngMaFaFbCx09077-01 tkp:agroforestryUses "Primary host species for commercial Sandalwood (Santalum spicatum) plantations in Western Australia. Nitrogen-fixing ability improves soil fertility. Used in revegetation and land rehabilitation projects, carbon farming, and mine site rehabilitation." .
