treekipedia:AngMaFaFbCx09077-01 tkp:associatedSpecies "Found in eucalypt woodland with various Eucalyptus species. Closely related to A. burkittii with overlapping ranges. Associated with Santalum spicatum (Sandalwood) as primary host. Also grows with Allocasuarina species in revegetation projects." .
