treekipedia:AngMaFaFbCx09077-01 dwc:habitat "Grows on brown or red-brown loam or clay-loam flats (pH 6-7) in tall shrubland or open eucalypt woodland. Also found on sandy loam around granite rocks, lateritic gravels, red-brown earths in low semi-arid woodlands, and near intermittent streams." .
