treekipedia:AngMaFaFbCx09077-01 tkp:plantingRecipes "Sow seeds in early spring after scarification. Soak in hot (not boiling) water overnight, then plant 5mm deep in free-draining potting mix. Keep in full sun for 2-4 weeks until germination. Transplant to permanent position in full sun with good drainage." .
