treekipedia:AngMaFaFbCx09077-01 tkp:stewardshipPractices "Plant in full sun with well-drained soil. Once established requires minimal maintenance. Drought, frost, and salt tolerant. Does not tolerate waterlogging or high humidity. Slower to establish than other Acacias but hardy once rooted." .
