treekipedia:AngMaFaFgCx14878-00 tkp:agroforestryUses "Wildlife habitat plantings: Important for mule deer, javelina, bighorn sheep, and birds. Erosion control: Thicket-forming growth stabilizes rocky slopes. Windbreaks: Multi-stemmed form provides low windbreak in rangeland. Silvopasture: Traditional grazing lands include oak-juniper communities with Q. pungens. Native habitat restoration: Used in Sky Island and Edwards Plateau restoration projects." .
<https://treekipedia.silvi.earth/ontology#insight_bd44a9ef-b8a1-4bfd-82a2-948eff76db5e> a tkp:Insight ;
