treekipedia:AngMaFaFgCx14878-00 tkp:associatedSpecies "Trees/shrubs: Gray oak (Quercus grisea - hybridizes), Mohr shin oak (Q. mohriana), Plateau oak (Q. fusiformis), Oneseed juniper (Juniperus monosperma), Pinyon pine (Pinus edulis), True mountain-mahogany (Cercocarpus montanus), Desert ceanothus (Ceanothus greggii), Mexican buckeye (Ungnadia speciosa), Texas persimmon (Diospyros texana). Cacti: Cane cholla (Opuntia imbricata), Purple-fruited pricklypear (Opuntia phaeacantha). Grasses: Hairy tridens (Erioneuron pilosum)." .
