treekipedia:AngMaFaFgCx14878-00 tkp:climate_tolerance "Temperature: Moderately cold-hardy, tolerates temperatures to approximately -15°C when dormant. Requires hot summers for proper wood ripening; performs poorly in cool-summer maritime climates. Rainfall: Adapted to semiarid conditions (300-500mm annual). Heat: High tolerance. Frost: Moderate tolerance when dormant. Climate type: Hot, dry summers; mild winters with occasional frost." .
