treekipedia:AngMaFaFgCx14878-00 tkp:compatibleSoilTypes "Strongly prefers limestone soils; also found on igneous substrates. Grows in gravelly, rocky, shallow soils (typically <25cm deep). Soil texture: stony clay to rocky. Tolerates nutritionally poor soils. Does not occur in deep sand (insufficient anchorage and moisture). Found in cracks and thin soils atop limestone hills. Well-adapted to rocky, skeletal soils typical of desert mountain slopes." .
