treekipedia:AngMaFaFgCx14878-00 dwc:occurrenceStatus "IUCN Red List: Least Concern (LC) - assessed by Kenny & Wenzell in 2015. Population trend: Stable. The species is abundant throughout its range and mostly occurs in protected areas. Scattered southern subpopulations face potential future threats but these are not considered significant for species-wide survival." .
