treekipedia:AngMaFaFgCx14878-00 tkp:deciduousEvergreen "Evergreen to semi-evergreen (subevergreen). Leaves persist through winter but may be partially shed during extreme cold or drought. Classified as evergreen in milder parts of range, semi-evergreen where winters are colder. Bright glossy green when young, darkening with age." .
