treekipedia:AngMaFaFgCx14878-00 tkp:diseasePestManagement "No major disease or pest problems documented specifically for Q. pungens. General oak concerns include: Oak wilt (limited risk in arid range), root rot (avoid overwatering), borers (maintain plant vigor). Acorn weevils may affect seed crop. The species appears relatively resistant to pests and diseases within its native range." .
