treekipedia:AngMaFaFgCx14878-00 tkp:elevationRange "800-2000 meters (2,600-6,600 feet). Most commonly found at 1,067-1,829m (3,500-6,000 ft). In Edwards Plateau around 1,750m (5,750 ft). Lower Sonoran Life Zone through mid-elevation mountain slopes. Elevation varies by region: lower in Texas, higher in Arizona and New Mexico mountains." .
