treekipedia:AngMaFaFgCx14878-00 tkp:flowerColor "Monoecious with separate male and female flowers on same plant. Male flowers: Yellowish, in drooping catkins. Female flowers: Inconspicuous, greenish. Flowering period: Spring (March-May, varying by location). Wind-pollinated." .
