treekipedia:AngMaFaFgCx14878-00 tkp:lifespan "No specific longevity data available for Quercus pungens in literature. As a white oak group member in arid environments, likely has moderate lifespan. Root systems may persist much longer than individual stems due to resprouting habit. Estimated 100-200+ years possible for root systems; individual stems likely shorter-lived." .
