treekipedia:AngMaFaFgCx14878-00 tkp:maximumDiameter "Typically small diameter due to shrubby growth form. No specific maximum DBH documented in literature. Multi-stemmed individuals have numerous small-diameter stems rather than single large trunks. Tree-form specimens may reach 15-25cm DBH but this is uncommon." .
