treekipedia:AngMaFaFgCx14878-00 tkp:nativeHabitats "Native to: Arizona (southeastern), New Mexico (southwestern), Texas (Edwards Plateau, Trans-Pecos, Guadalupe Mountains), and northeastern Mexico (Chihuahua, Coahuila, Durango, Nuevo León, Tamaulipas, San Luis Potosí, Veracruz). Adapted to: Chihuahuan Desert Sky Islands, Madrean woodlands, Edwards Plateau. Climate zones: Semiarid to subhumid with hot summers, mild winters, and distinct dry season." .
