treekipedia:AngMaFaFgCx14878-00 tkp:propagation_methods "Seed (primary method): Sow fresh acorns immediately after collection; no pretreatment or stratification needed (white oak group). Protect from rodents. Use deep containers for taproot. Vegetative: Sprouts readily from root crown; root cuttings may be possible. Natural regeneration: Primarily by seed with animal dispersal; also spreads vegetatively through root sprouting." .
