treekipedia:AngMaFaFgCx14878-00 tkp:pruningMaintenance "Minimal pruning required for natural growth. Multi-stemmed form: Thin competing stems if desired for tree form. Timing: Prune during dormant season (winter). Natural form: Allow shrubby, thicket-forming habit in restoration plantings. Remove dead or damaged stems as needed. Species tolerates coppicing and regenerates vigorously from root crown." .
