treekipedia:AngMaFaFgCx14878-00 tkp:tolerances "Drought: High tolerance; adapted to xeric conditions of Chihuahuan Desert region. Fire: Relies entirely on resprouting for persistence; thin bark provides minimal fire protection but vigorous post-fire sprouting. Heat: High tolerance. Poor soils: High tolerance; thrives in nutritionally poor, rocky substrates. Shade: Low tolerance; prefers full sun. Salt: No specific information; likely low tolerance. Wind: Moderate tolerance due to shrubby growth form." .
