treekipedia:AngMaFaFgCx14880-00 tkp:associatedSpecies "Understory dominants: Erica arborea, Erica australis (heaths); Cytisus scoparius (broom); Vaccinium myrtillus (bilberry, rare). Common associates: Lonicera periclymenum, Rubus ulmifolius, Prunus avium, Festuca rothmaleri, Brachypodium rupestre. Atlantic fringe additions: Ulex gallii, Genista florida, Daboecia cantabrica, Rubia peregrina, Tamus communis. Transition zones with: Quercus ilex (holm oak), Quercus petraea (sessile oak), Fagus sylvatica (beech), Pinus pinaster. Riparian associates: Populus spp., Fraxinus excelsior, Alnus glutinosa." .
