treekipedia:AngMaFaFgCx14880-00 tkp:barkCharacteristics "Young trees: Smooth, grayish-green bark. Mature trees: Develops longitudinal cracks and furrows, becoming darker (gray to dark brown) with age. Texture becomes rough and fissured. Not corky. Contains tannins used historically for leather tanning." .
