treekipedia:AngMaFaFgCx14880-00 dwc:occurrenceStatus "IUCN Red List: Least Concern (LC) as of 2022. Protected under European legislation as Natura 2000 habitat type 9230. Listed in the Habitats Directive 92/43/EEC. Despite LC status, faces significant threats from wildfires, climate change, insect pathogens (Tortrix viridana, Lymantria dispar, Euproctis chrysorrhoea), and historical degradation from coppicing and overgrazing." .
