treekipedia:AngMaFaFgCx14880-00 tkp:deciduousEvergreen "Deciduous with marcescent tendency. Leaves die in autumn but are retained through winter, particularly on young trees and lower branches. Dead leaves are shed only in spring when new growth emerges. This marcescence is an adaptation to Mediterranean climates with hot, dry summers." .
<https://treekipedia.silvi.earth/ontology#insight_c9044f62-b500-4bc1-aa3e-24138b337efb> a tkp:Insight ;
