treekipedia:AngMaFaFgCx14880-00 tkp:elevationRange "Sea level to 2,100 meters. Most commonly found in mid-mountain areas (400-1,600m). Reaches highest elevations (up to 2,100m) in Sierra Nevada, Spain. Distribution spans wide altitudinal range throughout western Atlantic-Mediterranean regions." .
