treekipedia:AngMaFaFgCx14880-00 tkp:flowerColor "Monoecious with separate male and female flowers on same tree. Male flowers: yellowish, in long drooping catkins (5-10 cm), turning from grey to gold in late spring. Female flowers: greenish, inconspicuous, solitary or in small groups of 2-4, without catkins. Flowering period: April-May (late spring), coinciding with leaf emergence." .
