treekipedia:AngMaFaFgCx14880-00 tkp:identification_features "Deciduous to marcescent tree up to 25m tall with irregular crown. Leaves very variable (8-22 cm long), deeply lobed with 4-7 lobes per side, velvety texture on both sides, dark glossy green above with sparse starry down, grey-felted beneath. Young shoots densely clothed with grey down. Bark initially smooth and grayish-green, becoming cracked and dark with age. Trunk often slender and tortuous. Acorns 2-4 together on downy stalks, about half-enclosed by cup with appressed downy scales." .
