treekipedia:AngMaFaFgCx14880-00 tkp:leafType "Simple, alternate, deciduous to marcescent. Very variable in size: 8-22 cm long, 4-12 cm wide. Deeply pinnately lobed with 4-7 rounded or pointed lobes per side. Larger lobes often coarsely round-toothed. Upper surface: dark glossy green with sparse, minute, starry pubescence. Lower surface: grey-felted with dense tomentum. Velvety texture on both surfaces. Spring emergence pinkish, turning deep green in summer, yellowish-brown in autumn." .
