treekipedia:AngMaFaFgCx14880-00 tkp:lifespan "Average lifespan: approximately 300 years. Individual trees may persist for 400-500 years under optimal conditions. Coppice stools (root systems) may be many hundreds of years old even when stems are periodically cut. Oldest documented trees date to late 1500s." .
