treekipedia:AngMaFaFgCx14880-00 dwc:measurementValue "Typical height: 15-25 meters. Maximum height: up to 30 meters in optimal conditions. Often stunted or shrubby (under 10m) in poor soils, high elevations, or heavily coppiced stands. Height growth is less responsive to silvicultural treatments compared to diameter growth." .
