treekipedia:AngMaFaFgCx14880-00 tkp:maximumTreeAge "Oldest documented specimens date to the late 1500s, suggesting maximum ages of approximately 400-500 years. These oldest trees are found at the coldest sites within the species range. Root systems of coppiced trees may be considerably older than visible stems." .
