treekipedia:AngMaFaFgCx14880-00 tkp:popular_common_name "Pyrenean Oak (English); Spanish Oak (English); Melojo, Rebollo, Roble Melojo (Spanish); Rebollu (Asturian); Chêne des Pyrénées, Chêne tauzin, Chêne-brosse (French); Carvalho-negral, Carvalho-pardo-das-beiras (Portuguese); Pyreneisk ek (Swedish); Pyreneese eik (Dutch)" .
