treekipedia:AngMaFaFgCx14888-00 tkp:agroforestryUses "Traditional use in wood pasture (silvopasture) systems since Roman times. Pigs released to feed on acorns (pannage). Coppice management for sustainable timber. Pollarding for wood products. Hedgerow trees for shade and windbreaks. Modern alley cropping potential for timber/pasture integration." .
