treekipedia:AngMaFaFgCx14888-00 tkp:associatedSpecies "Forms mixed forests with Fagus sylvatica (beech), Fraxinus excelsior (ash), Carpinus betulus (hornbeam), Tilia species (lime), Acer species (maple), Ulmus species (elm). Understory includes Corylus avellana (hazel), Crataegus (hawthorn), Ilex aquifolium (holly). Eurasian jays are primary seed dispersers." .
