treekipedia:AngMaFaFgCx14888-00 tkp:barkCharacteristics "Young trees have smooth gray-green bark. Mature trees develop deeply fissured bark with vertical ridges, gray-brown in color. Texture becomes increasingly rugged and corky with age. Fissures deepen significantly in old trees." .
