treekipedia:AngMaFaFgCx14888-00 tkp:climate_tolerance "Temperate climate species. Favors bright sunlight (light-demanding), moderate temperature, and adequate moisture. Ellenberg values: L=7 (light), T=6 (temperature), F=6 (moisture), R=5 (pH), N=2-6 (nutrients), S=0 (salinity). USDA Hardiness zones 5-8. Tolerates winter temperatures to -25C." .
