treekipedia:AngMaFaFgCx14888-00 tkp:compatibleSoilTypes "Prefers deep, fertile, well-watered loam soils. Thrives on medium (loamy) and heavy (clay) soils including heavy clay. Tolerates a range of pH from mildly acid to mildly alkaline. Lime tolerant. Grows well on calcareous to moderately acid soils. Avoids thin, dry, shallow soils and very poor sandy soils." .
