treekipedia:AngMaFaFgCx14888-00 dwc:occurrenceStatus "Listed as Least Concern on IUCN Red List. While globally secure, many populations are fragmented and degraded by habitat conversion. Primeval forests are now rare. Threatened locally by Acute Oak Decline, Oak Processionary Moth, and powdery mildew. 80% mortality reported in some UK AOD-affected areas." .
