treekipedia:AngMaFaFgCx14888-00 tkp:fireManagement "Mature oaks have moderate fire resistance due to thick bark, but young trees are vulnerable. Historically, prescribed burning was not common in European oak management. Remove accumulated debris from around veteran trees. Oaks can resprout from base after fire damage." .
