treekipedia:AngMaFaFgCx14888-00 tkp:flowerColor "Monoecious with separate male and female flowers on same tree. Male flowers in yellowish-green pendulous catkins 2-4cm long. Female flowers tiny, inconspicuous, reddish-green. Flowers appear in April-May with or just after leaf emergence." .
