treekipedia:AngMaFaFgCx14888-00 tkp:growthForm "Large deciduous tree with broad, spreading, irregularly shaped crown. Single trunk that often becomes gnarled and hollow with age. Branches often twisted and spreading, especially in open-grown specimens. Deep taproot when young, developing extensive lateral root system at maturity." .
