treekipedia:AngMaFaFgCx14888-00 tkp:leafType "Simple, obovate leaves with 4-5 pairs of rounded lobes. 10-12cm long. Dark green above, paler blue-green beneath. Very short petiole (2-7mm). Distinctive auricles (ear-like projections) at leaf base. Sinuses extend about halfway to midrib. Leaves clustered at branch tips." .
