treekipedia:AngMaFaFgCx14888-00 tkp:lifespan "Extremely long-lived species. Average lifespan 300-500 years. Can live 500-1000+ years in exceptional cases. Natural lifespan between 300-900 years in European oak woodlands. Some ancient specimens estimated over 1,000 years old." .
