treekipedia:AngMaFaFgCx14888-00 tkp:plantingRecipes "Best planted as acorns in autumn (October-November) or bare-root transplants in dormant season (November-March). Sow acorns 5cm deep in deep pots or direct in ground with rodent protection. Germination in 4-6 weeks. Transplant seedlings at 2-3 years old. Avoid disturbing taproot." .
