treekipedia:AngMaFaFgCx14888-00 tkp:propagation_methods "Primarily propagated from seed (acorns). Collect in autumn when brown; float test for viability. Q. robur does not require stratification - can be sown immediately. Plant 5cm deep. Germination in 4-6 weeks. Can also be grafted for cultivar propagation. Cuttings difficult to root." .
