treekipedia:AngMaFaFgCx14888-00 tkp:pruningMaintenance "Minimal pruning required. If needed, prune in late winter/early spring (February-March) when dormant. Remove dead, diseased, or crossing branches. Formative pruning for young trees to establish strong structure. Avoid heavy pruning of mature trees. Never remove more than 25% of crown." .
