treekipedia:AngMaFaFgCx14888-00 tkp:stewardshipPractices "Plant in full sun to partial shade in deep, fertile soil. Provide adequate space (15-20m crown spread at maturity). Protect from livestock when young. Monitor for Acute Oak Decline and Oak Processionary Moth. Maintain deadwood habitat for biodiversity. Avoid soil compaction around root zone." .
