treekipedia:AngMaFaFgCx14888-00 tkp:synonyms "Quercus robur is the type species of the genus Quercus and is classified in the white oak section (Quercus section Quercus). Trade names for the timber include French Oak, Polish Oak, Slavonian Oak, depending on geographic origin." .
