treekipedia:AngMaFaFgCx14888-00 tkp:timberValue "Highly valued hardwood. Density ~720 kg/m3. Extremely durable heartwood prized for furniture, construction, shipbuilding, flooring, timber frames, barrels (cooperage). Takes 150+ years to mature for construction timber. One of the best building materials. Premium prices for quality logs." .
