treekipedia:AngMaFaFgCx14888-00 tkp:tolerances "Tolerates waterlogging and flooding for up to 3 months. Once established, moderately drought tolerant on deep soils. Wind tolerant. Pollution tolerant, suitable for urban environments. Salt tolerance low. Tolerates lime/alkaline conditions." .
