treekipedia:AngMaMaMlVc33502-00 tkp:associatedSpecies "Savanna tree associates: Acacia/Senegalia spp. (acacias), Commiphora spp. (myrrh), Sterculia spp., Colophospermum mopane (mopane), Combretum spp. Parkland agroforestry associates: Vitellaria paradoxa (shea), Parkia biglobosa (néré), Faidherbia albida, Tamarindus indica (tamarind). Wildlife associates: Straw-coloured fruit bat (Eidolon helvum), Gambian epauletted fruit bat, Egyptian fruit bat (pollinators); African elephants, baboons (seed dispersers); weaver birds, galagos (nectar feeders); African honey bees (nest in hollows). Understory: Typically minimal due to arid conditions; grasses and drought-tolerant shrubs." .
