treekipedia:AngMaMaMlVc33502-00 tkp:climate_tolerance "Temperature: Optimal mean annual 20-30°C; very sensitive to frost (cannot tolerate even brief frost exposure). Rainfall: Thrives in 250-1000mm annual precipitation; tolerates extremes from 100mm to 1500mm. Dry season: Requires 4-10 months dry period; sheds leaves during drought. Drought: Exceptional tolerance once established; trunk stores massive water reserves. Heat: Highly tolerant of extreme heat. Humidity: Prefers low to moderate humidity. USDA hardiness zones: 10b-12 (minimum 2°C/35°F)." .
