treekipedia:AngMaMaMlVc33502-00 tkp:compatibleSoilTypes "Prefers well-drained, sandy to loamy soils. Tolerates poor, nutrient-deficient soils. Optimal pH: slightly acidic to neutral (pH 5.5-7.0), can grow in very acidic soils. Tolerates: light (sandy), medium (loamy), and heavy (clay) soils if well-drained. Avoids: deep sand (insufficient anchorage), waterlogged soils (very sensitive to waterlogging). Often found on stony, rocky substrates. Prefers sites with high water table access despite surface aridity." .
