treekipedia:AngMaMaMlVc33502-00 tkp:deciduousEvergreen "Deciduous. Leaves shed at the beginning of the dry season. Tree remains leafless for approximately 8 months of the year. New leaves emerge after first significant rains of wet season. This prolonged leafless period is an adaptation to extreme drought conditions in savanna habitats, minimizing water loss during the dry season." .
