treekipedia:AngMaMaMlVc33502-00 tkp:elevationRange "Sea level to 1,500 meters. Most commonly found in lowland areas below 1,000m. In East Africa, found up to higher elevations (historically described as A. kilima, now synonymized). Prefers warm lowland regions with pronounced dry seasons." .
