treekipedia:AngMaMaMlVc33502-00 dwc:habitat "Hot, dry savannas, woodlands, and semi-arid regions of tropical and subtropical Africa. Characteristic of thorn woodlands and African savannas with 4-10 dry months per year. Restricted to frost-free areas with low to moderate rainfall (100-1000mm annually). Found on well-drained, stony soils. Occurs from sea level to 1,500m elevation. Often found near villages and in traditional agroforestry parklands. Grows as solitary individuals or in small groups." .
