treekipedia:AngMaMaMlVc33502-00 tkp:identification_features "Massive deciduous tree with hugely swollen, bottle-shaped trunk up to 10-14m diameter, smooth grey bark resembling elephant skin. Palmately compound leaves with 5-7 (up to 9) leaflets. Large pendulous white flowers (up to 20cm diameter) on long drooping stalks, opening at night. Large egg-shaped fruit (up to 25cm long) with hard woody shell and dry powdery pulp containing kidney-shaped black seeds. Crown branches resemble roots, giving upside-down appearance. Leafless for approximately 8 months of the year." .
<https://treekipedia.silvi.earth/ontology#insight_0d403da8-6fd5-4f66-85cb-f1838c15c757> a tkp:Insight ;
