treekipedia:AngMaMaMlVc33502-00 dwc:measurementValue "Typical height: 15-25 meters (50-82 feet). Maximum height: up to 30 meters (100 feet) in exceptional specimens. Often appears relatively short compared to trunk diameter due to its squat, bottle-shaped growth form. Crown spread can exceed 30m." .
