treekipedia:AngMaMaMlVc33502-00 tkp:popular_common_name "African Baobab (English); Baobab (English, French, widely used); Dead-rat Tree (from fruit appearance); Monkey-bread Tree (from edible fruit); Upside-down Tree (from root-like branch appearance); Cream of Tartar Tree (from powdery fruit pulp); Boab, Boaboa (regional); Tabaldi (Arabic); Mowana (Tswana); Kremetart, Kremetartboom (Afrikaans); Mbuyu (Swahili); Isimuhu (Zulu); Muvhuyu (Venda)" .
