treekipedia:AngMaMaMlVc33502-00 tkp:pruningMaintenance "Minimal pruning required for established trees. Natural form should be maintained; avoid heavy crown reduction. Remove dead or damaged branches as needed. Trees tolerate coppicing (cutting to ground) and resprout vigorously. In cultivation: Suitable for bonsai due to caudiciform growth; responds well to root pruning. Young trees: Can be shaped through selective pruning. Avoid pruning during active growth period (wet season)." .
